  "description": "A dynaset over PA INNER JOIN CH (CHID 1 and 2 share parent 1; CHID 3 has parent 2) and a second dynaset over the same join at its second row, inside BeginTrans and rolled back. On the first, at row 1: Edit, assign V 'changed', read V, Update, read V, Errors; MoveNext and read V (second child of parent 1); MoveNext and read V; the second dynaset reads V; Requery both and read all rows of each. Asks whether the parent field change through one occurrence is seen in the other occurrence and in the other cursor, before and after Requery. The fixture copy is opened read-write.",
